                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Last week, I welcomed @WhipKClark  to Mississippi\u2019s Second District.\n\nWe toured rural hospitals threatened by House Republicans\u2019 \u201cBig Ugly Bill\u201d and held a powerful town hall in Quitman County.\n\nThese stories matter and we\u2019re bringing them back to Congress to fight for change. \n\nThank you, Whip Clark.",
