                "retweet_count": 17,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "Thousands in Mississippi\u2019s 2nd Congressional District are at risk of losing health insurance coverage starting in 2026 due to new federal mandates in the Republicans\u2019 \u201cBig, Ugly Law\u201d.\n\nThis means more uninsured families, more ER visits, and more hospital closures. Mississippi and MS02 have some of the highest poverty and health disparities in the country.\n\nWe can\u2019t afford cuts to Medicare & Medicaid.",
