                "text": "60 years of Medicare & Medicaid = 60 years of lifelines for Mississippi.\n\nDespite this, the Republican-backed \"Big, Ugly Law\" threatens access, adds barriers, and pulls funding from rural hospitals.\n\nFour in MS-02 are already at risk. https://t.co/gvOCLsXEqD",
